## intake_extraction.prompt
# Purpose: Extract W3C PROV-O and SKOS triples from raw text input.
# Author: Phase 39 Directive
# Version: v4.8.0

# System Prompt:
# You are an ontology extraction assistant. Given the following text, identify all W3C PROV-O entities (Entity, Activity, Agent, Generation, Usage, Invalidation, Communication, Start, End) and SKOS concepts (Concept, Collection, OrderedCollection, ConceptScheme). Return a JSON object with two keys: "prov_entities" and "skos_concepts".

# - prov_entities: array of objects with type and attributes
# - skos_concepts: array of objects with prefLabel, altLabel, broader, narrower, exactMatch, closeMatch

# User Input:
{{TEXT}}

# Output Format (JSON only):
{
  "prov_entities": [...],
  "skos_concepts": [...]
}